The fixtures in this folder are copied unchanged from the tests of
https://github.com/Jakeschincariol/day-trader-skill:

- TSLA-2026-10-19-5m.json      tests/fixtures/trader-entry/TSLA-2026-10-19-5m.json
- TSLA-60d5m.json.gz           the Time Machine test's TSLA-60d5m.json.gz
                               (Yahoo chart, 60 days of 5-minute bars,
                               fetched 2026-10-19 10:49 ET)
- daily-spark-2026-10-19.json  tests/fixtures/trader-scanner/daily-spark-2026-10-19.json
- wall5m-2026-10-19.json.gz    tests/fixtures/trader-scanner/wall5m-2026-10-19.json.gz

They are Yahoo Finance responses saved by the skill's author, used under this
